# NT system service table: name number.
# PROVISIONAL numbering generated from the Nt* surface kernel32 uses. The syscall ABI and final numbers
# belong to the kernel (task #12, astra); ntdll's stubs are generated from this file, so changing a number here
# is the only edit needed on the user-mode side.
NtCreateFile 0
NtOpenFile 1
NtReadFile 2
NtWriteFile 3
NtQueryInformationFile 4
NtSetInformationFile 5
NtQueryAttributesFile 6
NtFlushBuffersFile 7
NtClose 8
NtDuplicateObject 9
NtAllocateVirtualMemory 10
NtFreeVirtualMemory 11
NtProtectVirtualMemory 12
NtQueryVirtualMemory 13
NtCreateEvent 14
NtSetEvent 15
NtResetEvent 16
NtCreateMutant 17
NtReleaseMutant 18
NtCreateSemaphore 19
NtReleaseSemaphore 20
NtWaitForSingleObject 21
NtWaitForMultipleObjects 22
NtDelayExecution 23
NtQueryPerformanceCounter 24
NtQuerySystemTime 25
NtTerminateProcess 26
NtQuerySystemInformation 27
NtWaitForAlertByThreadId 28
NtAlertThreadByThreadId 29
NtDeviceIoControlFile 30
NtQueryVolumeInformationFile 31
NtCreateThreadEx 32
NtCreateUserProcess 33
NtTerminateThread 34
NtSuspendThread 35
NtResumeThread 36
NtYieldExecution 37
NtOpenThread 38
NtOpenProcess 39
NtQueryInformationThread 40
NtSetInformationThread 41
NtQueryInformationProcess 42
NtQueryDirectoryFile 43
NtQueryFullAttributesFile 44
NtCreateSection 45
NtOpenSection 46
NtMapViewOfSection 47
NtUnmapViewOfSection 48
NtFlushVirtualMemory 49
